window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>“I wouldn’t miss a Kim Harrison book for anything.”<br>—Charlaine Harris, author of the Sookie Stackhouse novels</p><p> </p><p><em>Black Magic Sanction </em>is the most complex and emotionally charged adventure yet in author Kim Harrison’s <em>New York Times </em>bestselling series featuring bounty hunter-witch Rachel Morgan. A spellbinding story set once again Cleveland’s vampire, demon, and other supernatural beings-infested Hollows, <em>Black Magic Sanction </em>has the intrepid Rachel trapped in a life-or-death battle against her own kind in a sensational urban fantasy that shows why Kim Harrison deservedly stands in the superstar ranks alongside Charlaine Harris, Jim Butcher, and Laurell K. Hamilton.</p>"; 
